{"id": "14-1559-2-5", "zh": "说“**任意**”，是为了什么？", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-1559-6-11", "zh": "例如：manena、tejena、vasena。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1560-2-6", "zh": "说“**在元音前**”，是为了什么？", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-1560-7-12", "zh": "例如：mano、tejo、yaso。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1561-2-10", "zh": "此外，通过“ādi（等）”一词，在其他词缀之前也会增加 s 音。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "14-1561-11-14", "zh": "例如：mānasikaṃ、vācasikaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1562-2-12", "zh": "185，112。santa 一词在 bh 前变为 sa，并且在词尾增加 b。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "14-1563-2-17", "zh": "当后面是 bh 音时，整个 santa 一词替换为 sa，并且在词尾增加 b 音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-1564-2-4", "zh": "只应当与善人相处，", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1565-2-4", "zh": "只应当与善人结交。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1566-2-4", "zh": "了解了善人的正法，", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1567-2-6", "zh": "人就会变得更好，而不会变得更坏。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1568-2-6", "zh": "装饰华美的国王车乘确实会朽坏，", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1569-2-6", "zh": "这身体也同样会走向衰老，", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1570-2-7", "zh": "但善人的法不会衰老，", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1571-2-6", "zh": "善人确实会向善人宣说。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1572-2-5", "zh": "例如：sabbhūto、sabbhāvo。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1573-2-5", "zh": "说“**在 bh 前**”，是为了什么？", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-1573-6-9", "zh": "例如：santehi pūjito bhagavā（世尊受到善人的供养）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1574-2-7", "zh": "使用“ca”一词，是为了表明有时只出现 sa 音。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "14-1574-8-11", "zh": "例如：sakkāro、sakkato。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1575-2-11", "zh": "196，107。在 si 前，gacchanta 等词的 nta 变为 aṃ。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "14-1576-2-9", "zh": "在 si 前，gacchanta 等词的 nta 音可以任意变为 aṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1577-2-17", "zh": "例如：gacchaṃ、gacchanto，mahaṃ、mahanto，caraṃ、caranto，khādaṃ、khādanto。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1578-2-5", "zh": "说“**gacchanta 等词的**”，是为了什么？", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-1578-6-13", "zh": "例如：anto、danto、vanto、santo。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1579-2-9", "zh": "187，108。在其余的情况下，nta 视同 ntu。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-1580-2-9", "zh": "在其余的格尾和词缀前，gacchanta 等词的 nta 音应当看作 ntu 词缀。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-1581-2-13", "zh": "例如：gacchato、mahato，gacchati、mahati，gacchatā、mahatā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1582-2-5", "zh": "说“**在其余的情况下**”，是为了什么？", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-1582-6-13", "zh": "例如：gacchaṃ、mahaṃ、caraṃ、khādaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1583-2-11", "zh": "188，115。在 brahma、atta、sakha、rāja 等词之后，aṃ 变为 ānaṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-1584-2-12", "zh": "在 brahma、atta、sakha、rāja 这类词之后，aṃ 格尾可以任意变为 ānaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1585-2-17", "zh": "例如：brahmānaṃ、brahmaṃ，attānaṃ、attaṃ，sakhānaṃ、sakhaṃ，rājānaṃ、rājaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1586-2-5", "zh": "说“aṃ”，是为了什么？", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-1586-6-7", "zh": "例如：rājā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1587-2-10", "zh": "189，113。si 也是如此。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "14-1588-2-12", "zh": "在 brahma、atta、sakha、rāja 这类词之后，si 格尾也变为 ā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1589-2-11", "zh": "例如：brahmā、attā、sakhā、rājā、ātumā。", "confidence": 85}
